Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:31.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,RL1 packets carry request data. They carry no payment authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:38.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second disconnected browser: an actual QR image is decoded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:48.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fragments reconstructed. Import provenance remains untrusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:59.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Real local MiniLM inference: explainable similarity, not a fraud probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:06.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Review controls shown with an automated test fixture. AI has no financial authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:12.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Separate incurred-expense claim: explicit confirmation. No reimbursement transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:18.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Claim review works. Payout entitlement remains unverified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:23.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sandbox authorization boundary exercised by a labeled automated fixture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:34.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Honest payment status: credentials missing. No PayPal order or capture executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:42.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Actual SQLite events validate as a SHA-256-linked, tamper-evident chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:50.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Offline continuity and local AI verified. Genuine Sandbox capture is the remaining gate.
